  "term": "baquet",
  "definition": "In the history of Mesmerism, the baquet was the apparatus set up for Mesmer's “magnetic” treatment, in which induced crisis-like symptoms were thought to help bring about recovery. The room where it was used for cures was known as the salle des crises.",
